{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-05-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'TRUIST ANNOUNCES RETIREMENT OF CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER DARYL BIBLE', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , MAY 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION (NYSE: TFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER DARYL BIBLE HAS MADE THE DECISION TO RETIRE FROM TRUIST AFTER A DISTINGUISHED 38-YEAR CAREER AND MORE THAN 14 YEARS WITH THE COMPANY.'}